{id:'dormant',icon:'🌱',cat:'Customer Growth',title:'The High-Value Dormant Customer',setup:'A formerly valuable customer has not ordered in more than a year and may use another supplier.',goal:'Learn what changed and reopen a useful relationship without leading with a discount.',opening:'I was reviewing the program we supported previously and realized it has been a while since we planned something together. Has the need changed?',lines:['We have someone else now.','Nothing is coming up.','The last process was harder than it should have been.'],coach:['Use history without sounding entitled.','Listen for service and contact changes.','Secure a future planning date when there is no immediate order.'],success:'A reason for dormancy and one qualified next step.',lesson:'dormant'},
{id:'art',icon:'🎨',cat:'Order Quality',title:'“Use the Same Logo as Last Time”',setup:'The customer says the art is unchanged, but the garment and decoration location are different.',goal:'Verify current details without frustrating the customer.',opening:'I’ll use the prior order as the reference. I still want to confirm the current garment, logo colors, location, size, and approval contact.',lines:['Why do we need another proof?','It is exactly the same.','Just copy the old order.'],coach:['Respect the prior order while checking changed variables.','Read the decoration plan back.','Confirm approval ownership and timing.'],success:'A complete decoration record with no assumptions.',lesson:'art'},
{id:'service',icon:'🧯',cat:'Customer Service',title:'The Customer Wants a Manager',setup:'A customer is upset about a missed expectation and does not want to speak with the rep anymore.',goal:'Acknowledge the impact, escalate correctly, and remain accountable for follow-through.',opening:'I understand why you want a manager involved. I will bring in the right person and stay responsible for the follow-through so you do not have to restart the conversation.',lines:['Nobody communicated with me.','This has happened before.','I want a credit.'],coach:['Do not argue about blame.','Separate verified facts from what is being investigated.','Give a correction and communication schedule.'],success:'A responsible escalation with a clear next update.',lesson:'update'}
